                                                "sense_id": "a573d09f-cba8-347c-95b9-572fa4bb3d7b",
                                                "text": "Twenty froggies went to school, down beside a rushy pool\nTwenty little coats of green, twenty vests all white and clean"
                                            }
                                        ]
